<title>USA: FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies six muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for sale today:</p>
<p>--Matteson, Ill., $5 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Savage, Minn., $2.705 million tax increment bonds.</p>
<p>--Savage, Minn., $4.97 million taxable tax increment bonds.</p>
<p>--Mesquite, Texas, $1.785 million certificates of obligation.</p>
<p>--Mesquite, Texas, $3.6 million water and sewer revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--North Richland Hills, Texas, $5.135 million wastewater bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
